--- Shader_12_PinkExtravaganza/storyboard/before
+++ Shader_12_PinkExtravaganza/storyboard/after
@@ -1 +1 @@
-Among the pink water, sagging sphere and assembled plural body, the student chooses an effect to keep. Bringing transformations, waves and view-dependent materials, they compose known colour and emission rules beside a supplied sine-displacement effect, recording which operation changes appearance and which moves vertices. The exhibit geometry, lamps and displacement are supplied. No new shader stage is required: the gain is deliberate composition and an account of what the surface actually does. They carry a material recipe without mistaking emitted colour for a lamp or decorative water for a fluid interaction.
+Among the pink water, sagging sphere and plural body, the student chooses an arrangement worth keeping. They bring the form, repetition, rim and layered field developed here, together with Melencolia’s earlier work of composition. Choosing a supplied body, they combine a limited set of those operations and record what each contributes. One alternate version keeps the geometry but changes its appearance. They distinguish whole-object transformation, supplied vertex deformation and fragment colour. The outcome is a material recipe with reasons for its choices, not a new compulsory technique. The room’s associations remain open: which setting is a default, and who gets to call its appearance excessive?
--- Shader_12_PinkExtravaganza/storyboard_short/before
+++ Shader_12_PinkExtravaganza/storyboard_short/after
@@ -1 +1 @@
-Use pink water, sagging sphere and plural body. Reuse transforms, waves and view-dependent materials. Compose colour and emission beside supplied sine displacement; identify appearance changes versus moving vertices. Supply geometry, lamps and displacement. Carry a deliberate material recipe; emission is not a lamp, nor decorative water fluid interaction. Open: composition station remains proposed; require no new shader stage.
+Use pink water, sagging sphere and plural body. Reuse Melencolia composition + retained form, repetition, rim and field. Compose limited known effects on supplied body; record choices. Check: make an alternate appearance with geometry fixed; distinguish transform/vertex/fragment. Carry material recipe. Supply lamps/geometry/deformation. Open: composition binding absent. No new compulsory syntax; pink alone is not a theory of queerness.
--- Shader_10_ReactionDiffusion/title/before
